e quickly  why to avoid further transmission of the  virus  we are facing a serious public health  problem mortality may increase  if the crowds continue but with  governments still resisting negotiating  the root causes of economic inequality  and refusing to condemn police violence  demonstrators promise  they will continue to protest alessandra  al jazeera
 

